# Great Temple 0i_temple_hall L0: three Lightflyers (GBUG e000500f0, e000500f8, e000500f9), light
# world. God-mode player listed, Created/Activated, stood at several distances from each (attack
# range window: telegraph, attack, beam damage; inside the minimum range), shot (hit colour),
# scanned (scan display model: ScanVisorRender), two killed by missiles (light Dead:
# timer to DeathDelete), one Deactivated, one Deleted. For tools/cov/specs/glowbug.py.
@f300 god 1; give missile 50; give scanVisor 1
@f320 objs Glowbug; obj e000500f0; obj e000500f8; obj e000500f9
@f340 send e000500f0 Create; send e000500f8 Create; send e000500f9 Create
@f360 send e000500f0 Activate; send e000500f8 Activate; send e000500f9 Activate
@f400 obj e000500f0; obj e000500f8; obj e000500f9
@f450 place e000500f0 player 6
@f700 obj e000500f0
@f750 place e000500f0 player 12
@f1000 obj e000500f0
@f1050 place e000500f8 player 3
@f1300 obj e000500f8
@f1350 shoot e000500f8
@f1400 shoot e000500f8 missile
@f1450 obj e000500f8
@f1500 place e000500f9 player 20
@f1700 obj e000500f9
@f1600 place e000500f0 player 0.5
@f1650 obj e000500f0
@f1750 scan e000500f9 20 150
@f1780 scan e000500f9 20 150
@f1810 scan e000500f9 20 150
@f1840 scan e000500f9 20 150
@f1870 scan e000500f9
@f1900 visor combat
@f2000 obj e000500f8
@f2050 shoot e000500f0 missile; shoot e000500f0 missile
@f2150 obj e000500f0
@f2200 objs Glowbug
@f2300 send e000500f9 Deactivate
@f2400 send e000500f9 Delete
@f2500 objs Glowbug
